    <string name="settings_media_controls_selected_categories_pattern" tools:ignore="PluralsCandidate">%1$d of %2$d categories</string>
    <string name="settings_media_controls_info_title">More Information</string>
    <string name="settings_media_controls_info_text">While enabled, HTTP Shortcuts exposes visible shortcuts as tracks of a simulated media player. Use the previous and next controls to select a shortcut and the play or pause control to trigger it.\n\nIf multiple, but not all, categories are selected, each category is presented as an album. Select “Change category” and press play or pause to switch to the next category. Hidden categories and hidden shortcuts are never included.\n\nThe simulation remains active in the background so that smartwatches and headphone buttons can find it. You can stop it at any time using the permanent notification or by disabling this setting.</string>
